  "details": "It is currently possible for the radial menu to be moved to an area mostly off-screen, making it difficult to revert to a usable area. I did this accidentally while playing around with the options in VR, and having the menu weirdly clamp towards the bottom of my headset screen. I fixed it at the time by just setting it to follow my hand again, but later discovered the setting applied to desktop as well, resulting in the screenshot below.\nIt shouldn't be possible for the user to put their menu here, rendering it mostly unusable.",
